ng of trivia at Hillwood! Celebrate autumnal gardens, remarkable artworks, and all things Hillwood with a fun and enlightening evening of","variants":[{"label":"Child (6-18)","price":5,"optionIdx":2},{"label":"Adult","price":20,"optionIdx":8}]},{"name":"Motor Court","desc":"Though this entrance is designed to be the back of the mansion-leaving the impressive welcome to the Georgian façade overseeing the Lunar Lawn and the woodlands of Rock Creek Park to the south-this entrance, with its abundant foliage of spring flowering azaleas, dogwoods, and distinctive purple-leaf plum, impresses on the visitor the enchanting oasis that awaits. In the center of the motor court sits a nineteenth-century stone sculpture of the Greek god Eros. Traditionally the most handsome of the immortals, this willowy god of love faces the driveway, welcoming Marjorie Post’s guests and foreshadowing a delightful visit. Adult: $20Senior: $17College Students: $10Child (6-18): $5Children","photo":"https://hillwoodmuseum.org/sites/default/files/styles/slideshow_image__1000px_x_620px_/public/2020-04/Mackenzie_motorcourt_gallery.jpg.webp?itok=29n0pTaC","variants":[{"label":"Child (6-18)","price":5,"optionIdx":4},{"label":"Adult","price":20,"optionIdx":10}]},{"name":"Onsite Wreath Workshop","desc":null,"photo":"https://hillwoodmuseum.org/sites/default/files/uploads/airplant-wreath2.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Child (6-18)","price":5,"optionIdx":5},{"label":"Adult","price":20,"optionIdx":11}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","cover":"https://hillwoodmuseum.org/sites/default/files/2020-03/CtG%20egg_HP_featured%20collection%20highlight.jpg","photos":["https://hillwoodmuseum.org/sites/default/files/2020-03/CtG%20egg_HP_featured%20collection%20highlight.jpg","https://hillwoodmuseum.org/sites/default/files/2020-03/HP_collection%20highlight_swivel%20chair_0.jpg","https://hillwoodmuseum.org/sites/default/files/styles/fp_wi